Z||000000||RobertVol||09-21-2000||10:05 PM||||I dont usually get into the racing thing with my car BUT today was an exception. <P>I took my car down to get an oil change and some detail work done on my car today. On my way back home I ran into one of those new V-6 eclipses. And I have no problem honestly with Rice Burners but the kid in this car was SOOOO irritating. He drives up beside me and then revs as he passes and then slows down right in front of me and then lets me pass and then slows down at the light and has the radio on so loud and alot of Boom Boom but I guess no Voom Voom because when we left the light and I rev'd up the 3.8 It felt Sooooo Good ! By the time I slowed down and he caught up he slowly passed by and didnt even look my way !!! hee hee <P>It wasnt even close ! I know its not a V-8 but man I thought this car was a little faster... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT Top 3.8 SC t top <BR>88GT T top 55k for sale<BR>  <A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A>  <BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fortunecity.com/marina/strand/1086/3eab6a20.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||fiero56||09-21-2000||10:19 PM||||Don't get too cocky. One of your fellow Fiero owners(me) with an '88 Formula(v-6 5-speed) just lost a friedly little stop-light race to a...get this...really old white woody station wagon driven by some guy who appeared to be in his late 40s. I wasn't expecting his car to do much, so I was pretty easy on the Fiero, until he started to pull away, I gunned it, but it was too late, plus this loud whine(turbo?) wound up from his engine bay, and he was GONE! Letterally, he must have gained 10 car lengths in a matter of seconds. I was so amazed I started laughing. Still, wasn't very happy I lost to a woody wagon. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||88formula||09-21-2000||10:20 PM||||A supercharged 3.8-liter Fiero is a really fast car. I know because I drove one. It felt like a high-powered v8 car. I bet he was surprised. ||||reg||1
Z||000003||88formula||09-21-2000||10:23 PM||||Fiero 56, that’s funny! You got beet by the perfect sleeper.||||reg||1
