Z||000016||Xtreme Fiero's||09-24-2000||08:09 PM||||new Eclipse's suck. The 99's are awsome Jut so you all know the GS-T(turbo) is faster than the GSX(Turbo AWD) <P>Eclipse GS-T:<P>2.2L DOHC Turbo 210 hp<BR>FWD<BR>Top speed: 140mph (govonor)<BR>1/4 mile: 13.7 (stock 5-speed)<P>2.2L DOHC Turbo 210 hp<BR>aWD<BR>Top speed: 139mph<BR>1/4 mile: 13.9 (stock 5-speed)<P>The AWD system adds alot of weight and alot more mass to the drive line. If you had trouble wuth a GSX don't even try a GS-T<BR>||||reg||1
